        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change addresses the updates made in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2059526\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 2059526</a> Add a way for extensions to determine the background position for nova (in the window background, or in the toolbox).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The change includes an update to the <code class=\"notranslate\">theme</code> manifest key page and a release note.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Corresponding changes to the BCD are included in PR TBC.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45362",
            "title": "Bug 2059526 Addition of theme property backgrounds_area",
            "date_modified": "2026-08-28T04:20:34.000Z",
