        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39562.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3072079703\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39562\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39562/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39562\">#39562</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I did not add this information to more places. The API landing page and the <code class=\"notranslate\">CookieStore</code> pages are very high-level and I don't think this information fits very nicely. It also has nothing to do with <code class=\"notranslate\">CookieStore</code> in particular; cookie storage is a browser mechanism, so if anything this should be in CHIPS or the HTTP cookies guide.</p>",
