        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93594?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">These will need some human care to check &amp; unslop them, but they're a decent starting point.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I erred on including too much, rather than missing stuff, so it's likely that some of these items should be deleted.</p>",
