        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87750369?u=ccc1f52005708ae16bcb50e325e02145bff0ef7d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Follow up on</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/911\">https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/911</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5203572534\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45259\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45259/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45259\">#45259</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The PR updates writing guidelines to instruct contributors to not use the <code class=\"notranslate\">{{Deprecated_Header}}</code> macro anymore. Because, now the deprecated status banner is being inferred from front-matter <code class=\"notranslate\">status</code> property or data from web-features repository.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Contributors need to know.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/911\">https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/911</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5203572534\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45259\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45259/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45259\">#45259</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45345",
            "title": "chore: Update writing guidlines and remove Deprecated_Header macro mentions",
            "date_modified": "2026-08-27T14:50:13.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-08-27T08:29:10.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "OnkarRuikar",
